# graphify code-structure graphs (regenerated by `graphify update`, ~7 MB).
# Generated artifact, not source: keeping it out also stops a careless `git add
# -A` from publishing it to this *public* repo. (The internal `paas` repo tracks
# its graph deliberately; if that is wanted here too, drop this line.)
graphify-out/
